blocks.en:
This axis determines what an agent can command.
We consider six abstractions:
Joint specifies joint-space targets;
Delta specifies relative translations and rotations;
Step provides fixed-magnitude motion commands;
Pose specifies absolute end-effector targets;
Point grounds actions in image-space locations; and
Skill exposes semantic operations such as picking, placing, pressing, pushing, and turning.
They differ in representation and control granularity rather than forming a strict hierarchy.

blocks.zh:
此轴决定代理人可以命令什么 。
我们认为有六个抽象之处:
确定联合空间目标;
三角洲指定相对翻译和旋转;
步骤提供固定宽度运动命令;
Pose指定了绝对最终效果目标;
在图像空间位置的点地面行动;以及
技能暴露了诸如采摘,放置,按压,推压,转动等语义操作.
它们在代表性和控制颗粒性上有所不同,而不是形成严格的等级.
